    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/kencypher56/cypher-releases/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>cypher-visualizer audio-visualizer visualizer music overlay desktop spectrum</tags>
    <summary>A real-time visualizer for whatever your computer is playing, drawn in a small desktop overlay.</summary>
    <description>Cypher Visualizer turns whatever your computer is already playing, from YouTube and Spotify to VLC and games, into a live visualization in a corner of your desktop. There is no window around it, no background and nothing to click: the mouse goes straight through to whatever sits underneath. Thirty visualizers, from GLava-style bars to 3D tunnels, follow the bass, mids and treble as they happen.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kencypher56/cypher-releases/releases/tag/cypher-visualizer-v1.1.0</releaseNotes>
